Hand-written deck with what Studio's own decks never use (import test)
c --- cells ------------------------------------------------------------
c a tank of water holding a rotated, translated block of universe 1, and a lattice
1 1 -1.0 -1 #10 #20 imp:n=1
c universe 1: an off-centre iron rod, placed by TRCL (tilted 30 deg about x and moved)
10 0 -2 *fill=1 (5 -4 3  0 90 90  90 30 60  90 120 30) imp:n=1
11 2 -7.87 -3 u=1 imp:n=1
12 0 3 u=1 imp:n=1
c a 3 x 2 lattice of universes 2 (lead pins) and 3 (empty), explicit fill array
20 0 -4 fill=4 imp:n=1
21 0 -5 lat=1 u=4 imp:n=1 fill=0:2 0:1 0:0 2 3 2 3 2 2
30 3 -11.35 -6 u=2 imp:n=1
31 LIKE 11 BUT u=2 mat=1 rho=-1.0 imp:n=1
32 0 -7 u=3 imp:n=1
99 0 1 imp:n=0

c --- surfaces ---------------------------------------------------------
1 RPP -40 40 -40 40 -40 40
2 RPP -6 6 -6 6 -6 6
3 RCC 2 1 -4 0 0 8 1.5
4 RPP -30 0 10 30 -5 5
5 RPP -30 -20 10 25 -5 5
6 RCC -25 17.5 -4 0 0 8 1.5
7 RPP -100 100 -100 100 -100 100

c --- data -------------------------------------------------------------
c Water
M1 1001 2 8016 1
MT1 lwtr.20t
c Iron
M2 26056 1
c Lead
M3 82208 1
SDEF POS=0 0 0 ERG=14.1
NPS 1000
F4:N 1
